     :claim "exact/< is a strict total order on ℚ (irreflexive, asymmetric, transitive)."
     :invariant "∀ a b c ∈ ℚ. ¬(a<a) ∧ (a<b → ¬b<a) ∧ (a<b ∧ b<c → a<c)"
