      (:code "(define (safe-inv a) (cond ((not (rational? a)) (error 'shape)) ((equal? a (exact/rat 0 1)) (error 'div-zero)) (else (exact/inverse a))))\n(safe-inv (exact/rat 3 4))" :tags (cs program)))
     :problem "Reciprocal calculations must guard against zero and preserve exactness."
     :explanation "eng: reciprocal. math: unit-scale. cs: type + zero guard."
     :meta "Reach for exact/inverse — clearer than exact// with 1.")
    (:eng "Reciprocal must reject zero." :math "Multiplicative inverse in ℚ." :cs "Partial function."))
  :row-3-dimension (
